  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Spell. Cause Searing Heat at target foe's location. For 5 seconds, foes near this location are struck for 10...34...40 fire damage each second. When Searing Heat ends, foes in the area of effect are set on fire for 3 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "在目標敵人處引發灼熱氣息。持續 5 秒，使接近灼熱氣息的敵人每秒受到 10～40 火焰傷害。當灼熱氣息停止，該區域的敵人將遭受「著火」病症 3 秒。"
    },
    "pvp": null
  },
